 ## [Unreleased]
 
+### Added
+
+- `ToolRegistry.execute` now automatically validates tool `input` against the tool's registered `inputSchema` using AJV. If validation fails, it immediately returns a `ToolResponse` describing the error without invoking the executor. Tool executors no longer need to implement their own input validation schemas or type coercion for required fields.
+
